  {"comment": "A mirrored tapped hole keeps its cosmetic thread (mitcad#2501): a 60 x 40 x 20 block (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2) with a cosmetic M6x1 6H hole 10 deep at (10, 10) on its top (Hole1 F3), tapped 4 long from 2 below its start, mirrored across the plane x = 30 (Mirror1 F4)."},
